{"id":"man_ana","lemma":"mañana","pos":"adv","rank":133,"glosses":["tomorrow","soon, shortly"],"ipa":"/maˈɲana/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/29/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodrigo5260-ma%C3%B1ana.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es por la mañana.","en":"It's morning.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/104537"},{"text":"Mañana va a llover.","en":"It'll rain tomorrow.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519231"},{"text":"Tuve una mañana ocupada.","en":"I had a busy morning.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454165"},{"text":"El mañana nunca llega.","en":"Tomorrow never comes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454962"},{"text":"Voy a verte mañana.","en":"I'll see you tomorrow.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453420"}]}